{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"乌兹别克斯坦","country_iso":"UZB","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:21:16.796062","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"UZB-HB-0032","ldc":"No","location":"撒马尔罕地区","location_norm":"撒马尔罕州","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"乌兹别克斯坦首座焚烧发电厂","project_name_en":"Uzbekistan First Waste-to-Energy Plant","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中亚经贸","content":"中国机械进出口总公司计划在乌兹别克斯坦建设第一座焚烧发电厂。该公司还将研究在撒马尔罕地区建造索道的可能性。\n乌兹别克斯坦生态部新闻处称，中国机械设备工程股份有限公司（CAMCE）有意在乌兹别克斯坦建造第一座垃圾焚烧发电厂。\n生态、环境保护和气候变化部部长阿齐兹-阿布杜哈基莫夫（Aziz Abdukhakimov）和公司董事长于 5月2日签署了关于该项目的合作备忘录。\n公司计划派遣一个专家小组研究和组织乌兹别克斯坦的废物管理工作，并制定工厂的初步设计提交给该国领导层。\n中亚国家经济共同体还将研究生态旅游领域的合作前景，以及在撒马尔罕山区修建新索道的可能性。\n12 月，生态部和 Tadweer（阿联酋）在迪拜举行的 COP28 气候峰会上签署了一份备忘 录，在固体废物管理领域引入 \"绿色 \"技术并启动焚烧发电厂。\n焚烧厂利用锅炉或熔炉中的热分解技术来利用工业和城市固体废物。在这种情况下通过利用燃烧热产生热量和电力。","content_sha256":"75887a15e6571360325045b991206d99458cfbecf76b7d3b41bddaa85867c6bd","id":8512,"publish_date":"2024-05-07 21:28:02","title":"中国公司计划在乌兹别克斯坦建设第一座焚烧发电厂","title_sha256":"3e10b9d84bf0dec9defe9817a41842cf9372e9467fac89fd195cfdc52cb3b82e","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/64982.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"UZB-HB-0032","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:21:16.796611","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"UZB-HB-0032-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://mm.chinapower.com.cn:42808/jnhb/ljfd/20240524/247494.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"中国机械设备工程股份有限公司","project_developer_en":"China Machinery Engineering Corporation (CMEC)","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国机械设备工程股份有限公司（CAMCE）计划在乌兹别克斯坦建设该国首座垃圾焚烧发电厂。该项目已签署合作备忘录，中方将派遣专家团队进行废物管理研究和工厂初步设计。项目具体装机容量和投产日期尚未披露。","publish_date":"2024-05-07 21:28:02","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/64982.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"UZB-HB-0032","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category"]}
